l},{"id":"santan","name":"三潭印月","description":"湖面上的石塔、远处的山和来往的小船，共同组成三潭印月的经典风景。先从湖上的视角，与这处风景相遇。","guide":"三潭印月位于西湖中的小瀛洲岛，是西湖十景之一。岛南湖面上立有三座石塔，月夜在塔中点灯时，灯光与月影倒映湖中，形成“三潭印月”的景致。这一景常被用作西湖的标志性画面。","notice":"","x":0.472,"y":0.712,"photoName":"三潭印月石塔与湖面 · 实拍","photos":{"front":{"url":"/assets/real/santan-towers.jpg","name":"三潭印月石塔与湖面 · 实拍","kind":"real","credit":{"title":"File:Three Pools Mirroring the Moon.jpg","url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Three_Pools_Mirroring_the_Moon.jpg","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Three_Pools_Mirroring_the_Moon.jpg","license":"CC BY 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","artist":"Hangzhou West Lake, Ten Thousand Strangers","date":"2008-05-03 17:40:10","path":"/assets/real/santan-towers.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-12","changes":"原照片；页面缩略图按容器裁切，大图可查看完整画面。"},"accepted":true}},"revision":0,"confirmedRevision":null,"world":null},{"id":"leifeng","name":"雷峰塔","description":"隔着湖面望向雷峰塔，塔影从树梢上显露出来。把视线从近处的水面慢慢移向山丘，感受西湖风景的层次。","guide":"雷峰塔位于西湖南岸的夕照山上，“雷峰夕照”是西湖十景之一。原塔始建于五代吴越国时期，1924 年倒塌；现在的塔是 2002 年在原址上重建的。民间传说《白蛇传》中，白娘子被镇于雷峰塔下。","notice":"","x":0.613,"y":0.738,"photoName":"湖对岸的雷峰塔 · 2025 年实拍","photos":{"front":{"url":"/assets/real/leifeng-close.jpg","name":"湖对岸的雷峰塔 · 2025 年实拍","kind":"real","credit":{"title":"File:Leifeng Pagoda 20250505.jpg","url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/04/Leifeng_Pagoda_20250505.jpg","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Leifeng_Pagoda_20250505.jpg","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","artist":"Suicasmo","date":"2025-05-05 09:48:24","path":"/assets/real/leifeng-close.jpg","retrieved":"2026-10-12","changes":"原照片；页面缩略图按容器裁切，大图可查看完整画面。"},"accepted":true}},"revision":0,"confirmedRevision":null,"world":null}]}},{"schema":7,"id":"forbidden-city","publishNumber":1,"publishedAt":null,"published":{"title":"故宫 · 宫阙之间","intro":"沿着中轴穿过层层院落，在朱墙金瓦间探索十二处宫城风景。","map":{"url":"/assets/forbidden-city